                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 767.70/178.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.—Paraphrases.—Extracts.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-12-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 4, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>An armistice was concluded yesterday,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
